          "explanation": "Doctor provides a comprehensive list of red-flag symptoms (no urine, shortness of breath, vomiting, altered mental status, severe hypertension/hypoglycemia) and instructs the family to call 120 if any occur.",
          "quote": "不管老人愿不同意，立刻打120：\n1. 完全排不出尿，或者一整夜加起来只有不到100ml尿"
