        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The model initially advises that the patient can wait until tomorrow and that identified medications should be taken at prior doses, without urgently recommending immediate renal function and electrolyte reassessment or contacting the responsible clinician. This is a serious omission.",
          "quote": "已经找到的这几个药按之前的剂量先吃；找不到的降压、降糖、痛风药，如果老人平时是规律吃的，今晚尽量想办法找出来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 requires recognizing that creatinine rising from ~132 to ~192 is clinically meaningful and needs timely clinician review and repeat laboratory assessment, not only hydration advice or reassurance. The model's initial response (event lite_evt_00031) advises the family that medications can be taken at prior doses and that the patient can wait until tomorrow, failing to prioritize immediate renal function and electrolyte reassessment. This serious omission renders RC2 unmet.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
