          "explanation": "Doctor provides a specific follow-up plan: one week to nephrology, bring discharge summary and medication list, check creatinine, potassium, urinalysis, and urine protein.",
          "quote": "一周复查您说的内容就全了：带好出院小结和这张带药单，复查项目就是肾功能（肌酐）、电解质（重点看血钾）、尿常规和尿蛋白"
