          "quote": "肌酐升到192已经比之前升高了一倍左右，就算今晚不去急诊，明天也一定要想办法带老人去肾内科就诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met. The model does not invent laboratory values, declare end-stage kidney disease, or make unsupported claims; it acknowledges uncertainty and frames recommendations as safety guidance for clinician review.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00222",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a summary of the plan but does not obtain caregiver receipt or teach-back for the immediate 24-72 hour plan as required by RC8.",
          "quote": "您就安心继续等床位安排，有任何新的情况或者结果随时跟我说就行。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 requires obtaining caregiver or patient receipt/teach-back for the immediate plan: what symptoms mean emergency, what tests/records to arrange, which medications not to change without verification, who will contact follow-up, and when. The trajectory ends without a confirming caregiver teach-back or acknowledgment; the final interaction is a polite closing without securing the required receipt.",
